## 7) Optional: Helm Chart skeleton (quick)

Create `charts/microservices/Chart.yaml` and templates per service if you want templated deploys. Helm is recommended for production.

`charts/microservices/templates/deployment.yaml` (simple excerpt)

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: {{ include "microservices.fullname" . }}-{{ .Values.name }}
spec:
  replicas: {{ .Values.replicaCount }}
  template:
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: {{ .Values.name }}
        image: "{{ .Values.image.repository }}:{{ .Values.image.tag }}"
        ports:
        - containerPort: {{ .Values.containerPort }}
```

